{"id":"9a0c699d574804ad","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-measure9-exchangeable-process.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Exchangeable Process","display":"df-zfc-measure9-exchangeable-process — ZFC Measure9 Exchangeable Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-exchangeable-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-exchangeable-process"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-exchangeable-process — ZFC Measure9 Exchangeable Process","depends_on":["[[58-df-bijective]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-probability-space]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-exchangeable-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-exchangeable-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-exchangeable-process — ZFC Measure9 Exchangeable Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bijective}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Bijective}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ExchangeableProcess}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ExchangeableProcess}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal S\\in V\">\\(\\vec X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> are the canonical function and bijection predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ExchangeableProcess}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ExchangeableProcess}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}exchangeable\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ExchangeableProcess}_S(\\vec X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal S,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(\\vec X(k),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\pi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,n,n)\\to\\forall B\\in\\mathcal S^n\\;\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i\\in n}\\vec X(i)^{-1}[B(i)]\\right)=\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i\\in n}\\vec X(\\pi(i))^{-1}[B(i)]\\right)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}exchangeable\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ExchangeableProcess}_S(\\vec X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal S,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(\\vec X(k),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\pi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,n,n)\\to\\forall B\\in\\mathcal S^n\\;\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i\\in n}\\vec X(i)^{-1}[B(i)]\\right)=\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i\\in n}\\vec X(\\pi(i))^{-1}[B(i)]\\right)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Exchangeability is relative to a specified probability space and measurable state space. Equality on all finite measurable rectangles expresses invariance of every finite-dimensional joint law without an undeclared distribution-equivalence symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-probability-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bijective}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","displ